WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.291
- It’s time for the Week 14 playoff picture.

00:00:01.291 --> 00:00:03.250
- It’s time for the—Damn you, Adam Schefter.

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:04.875
- Nice try, Rapoport.

00:00:04.958 --> 00:00:07.708
- Uh, should we be doing this in front of an active volcano?

00:00:07.791 --> 00:00:10.250
- Everything is totally normal. But please, Steelers, come over here.

00:00:10.458 --> 00:00:10.666
- Here?

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:11.541
- Actually, hurry, move again.

00:00:11.541 --> 00:00:12.500
- OH, LOOK! KETCHUP.

00:00:12.625 --> 00:00:13.625
- [Together:] Patrick, no!

00:00:13.625 --> 00:00:14.375
- Cheese.

00:00:16.958 --> 00:00:18.750
- Wait, who is in the NFC East spot?

00:00:18.916 --> 00:00:21.666
- HI, I’M KURT UNCLES AND I PLAY FOR THE DELAWARE CLAMS.

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:22.916
- OK, let’s move Gruden out.

00:00:22.916 --> 00:00:24.666
- Oh, per Adam Schefter, Gruden’s out.

00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:26.166
- I risked catching lava for this, man?

00:00:26.166 --> 00:00:27.833
- Any room for—OH GOD, OUR HOUSE.

00:00:27.958 --> 00:00:29.791
- DO YOU SMELL WHAT THE LAVA IS COOKING?

00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:30.541
It's us.

00:00:30.541 --> 00:00:31.625
- Yo, man. They can stay with me.

00:00:32.166 --> 00:00:33.541
Whoa, there’s a volcano here?! That's wack.

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:35.750
- The NFL has added precautions for safety.

00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:36.458
- ALL DONE!

00:00:36.875 --> 00:00:38.750
- I’m very disappointed in you, Drew Lock.

00:00:38.791 --> 00:00:41.250
- All right, Colts should somehow be in the photo.
Bring in their most exciting player.

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:44.958
- Hi, I’m Rodrigo Blankenship. This is just like the Star Wars planet Mustafar!

00:00:44.958 --> 00:00:45.791
- [Together:] What?
- Gesundheit!

00:00:45.833 --> 00:00:47.791
- According to reports, Lamar’s taken a step back.

00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:49.541
- I have not taken a step—AHHHH.

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:52.208
- OK, I am now hearing the volcano is in fact out of control.

00:00:52.208 --> 00:00:54.125
- BUT! Let me add: Run for your lives.

00:00:54.125 --> 00:00:55.250
- [Together:] AHHHHHHHH!

00:00:56.625 --> 00:00:58.375
- We make the playoffs and the world f--king ends.

00:00:58.375 --> 00:00:59.958
- MAKE SURE YOU TAG ME IN THIS.

00:01:02.586 --> 00:01:05.957
- [Schefter] Tua, over here, Tua. I'm the No. 1 guy. Tua.
- [Rapoport] Tua, hey, right here. Hey. Hi. Hey.

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.624
- [Schefter] This way, Tua. Look at me. Tua.
- [Rapoport] Right here, look at me, Tua. Tua, over here. No, Tua.

00:01:09.877 --> 00:01:13.249
- [Schefter] TUA. This way, to me.
- [Rapoport] Tua, no over here, Tua. Tua. Look at me, Tua. Tua.

